      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NSW Derby winner PASTOR DUNBAR (1) stretched his winning run to four when he returned with a win in the G3 Holmfield at this circuit and distance. Drew on the back row and raced parked there but was too tough. Will be fitter and the ace draw can see him deliver again. UNCLAD (3) disappointed in the Holmfield but he had a tough barrier. Much better served by this draw and he had recorded two wins and a second in his other three starts here since a spell so is worth another chance. IM HAVINTOTROT (7) continued his consistent form from last campaign when he came from this barrier to miss narrowly first up at Ballarat. Fitter so can progress off that. MISTER DEVEREAUX (2) draws well and cannot be left out after solid recent performances from tougher barriers.",
